# Universal Geographic Distance & Admin Mapper — Master Prompt

**Version:** 1.0  
**Works with:** Claude Sonnet / Opus (claude.ai or API)  
**Produces:** Excel sheets, interactive HTML maps, distance + travel-time tables  
**Geography:** Any country, state, district, or administrative division

---

## How to use this document

Copy the relevant prompt block below, fill in the `[ ]` placeholders, and paste it to Claude. Each prompt is self-contained — Claude needs no other context.

There are **four prompts** in this file:

| # | Prompt | What it makes |
|---|--------|---------------|
| 1 | Distance & Travel Time Sheet | Excel sheet: one origin → many destinations |
| 2 | Administrative Unit Workbook | Full Excel workbook for any region's admin divisions |
| 3 | Downloadable Interactive Map | Self-contained HTML choropleth map |
| 4 | Full Pipeline (all three above) | Everything at once |

