# Reference — What Claude needs to do its job accurately

The more of these you provide, the less Claude has to guess.

| You provide | Claude can do |
|-------------|---------------|
| Exact lat/lon of origin | Precise distance calculation |
| Pasted destination table with lat/lon | Zero coordinate hallucination |
| Expected unit count (e.g. "should be 15 blocks") | Self-verification |
| Census year | Accurate data citation |
| Known reorganisation dates | Correct boundary assignment |
| Sinuosity factor | Documented, reproducible road distances |
| Speed assumption | Documented, reproducible travel times |
| Boundary file URL | No CDN guessing |

